gnome-shell-extension-deepmon (1.0.11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix today's spending freezing between platform imports: the balance
    drop since the import baseline is added to the imported daily cost,
    and a stale baseline (import from another day) falls back to local
    balance deltas instead of showing yesterday's platform bucket.

